- * User client selectors used by CoreAnimation:
- *   3  GetLayerDefaultSurface [layer, ?] -> [IOSurface port name]
- *   4  SwapBegin -> [swap id]
- *   5  SwapEnd, struct 0x46c: +0x50 swap id, +0x54 IOSurface id per layer
